<pb n="124" facs="#f0140" xml:id="pb124_0001"/>
<p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Buffon</hi></hi></hi><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">,</hi> <hi rendition="#i">supplement</hi> vol</hi>. III. <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. LXII. LXIII.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">vol</hi>. VI <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. IV. V.</p>  <p rendition="#l1em">Häufig im südlichen Africa. Vor Zeiten auch im<lb/>
