riis duabus, confluentibus.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Klein</hi></hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">hist. piscium.</hi> Miss</hi>. II. <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. II. <hi rendition="#aq">fig.</hi> C. <hi rendition="#aq">Miss.<lb/>
