subcaudales</hi>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Fragilis</hi></hi>. die Blindschleiche, der Haselwurm,<lb/>
Hartwurm. (Engl. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">the blind-worm, the slow-worm</hi></hi>.)<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">A. squ. abd.</hi> 135. <hi rendition="#aq">totidemque subcaud</hi>. *</p>  <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Laurenti</hi></hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. V. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 2.</p>  <p rendition="#l1em">In dumpfigen Gegenden, alten Gemäuer &#xA75B;c. Bricht<lb/>
