aut clauato-perfoliatae. Pedes postici<lb/>
villosi, natatorii submutici</hi>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Piceus</hi>. D. antennis perfoliatis, corpore laeui,<lb/>
