ward</hi></hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">Lond</hi>. 1729. II. <hi rendition="#aq">Vol</hi>. 8.</bibl>  <bibl><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Lithophylacium</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#g">Bornianum</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">Prag</hi>. 1772. <hi rendition="#aq">sq</hi>. II. <hi rendition="#aq">Vol</hi>. 8.</bibl>  <bibl><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Catalogue de la collection des fossiles</hi> de Mlle <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k">de Raab</hi></hi>.<lb/>
